prompt.output_format:
Return ONLY a valid JSON object. No explanation. No markdown. No extra text. Exactly these 3 keys:
{ "reauth_required": "...", "reauth_requirements_text": "...", "_reasoning": "One sentence: which section you found reauth criteria in, or why reauth_required is NA (e.g. 'Found Continuation of Therapy section on page 5 requiring clinical response documentation')." }
Return ONLY a valid JSON object. Do NOT wrap your response in markdown code blocks. Do NOT use backticks. Do NOT prefix with ```json or any other text. Your entire response must start with { and end with }.

prompt.document:
Brand: {brand}
